<title>USA: Spartanburg Cty SD 5, S.C., won by Craigie.</title>
<headline>Spartanburg Cty SD 5, S.C., won by Craigie.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Craigie Inc said it won $4.100 million of Spartanburg County School District No. 5, S.C., general obligation bonds, 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.74 percent.</p>
</text>
